cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artefact, please cite it as below."
title: "When does fine-scale urban climate information matter? Analysis artefact"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived results for a decision-focused evaluation of urban
  climate information: thermal exposure and pedestrian accessibility to
  primary-care centres for adults aged 65 and over in Valencia, Spain. Contains
  no raw meteorological observations; AVAMET data must be requested from the
  network directly.
type: software
authors:
